  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h1>Purpose</h1><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"4b0e4d70-38cd-451f-ac98-c83405f3420f\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>It can be used to create a control to add a Birth Certificate</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><h1>Configuration</h1><h3>Add&nbsp;a birthCertificate directive</h3><p>Consider&nbsp;the following example to add&nbsp;a birthCertificate as a new directive:</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"17d94f20-36f0-4e17-adcc-65a80c5be9c0\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"linenumbers\">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA['use strict';\nangular.module('bahmni.common.displaycontrol.custom')\n    .directive('birthCertificate', ['observationsService', 'appService', 'spinner', function (observationsService, appService, spinner) {\n            var link = function ($scope,element) {\n                var conceptNames = [\"HEIGHT\"];\n                $scope.contentUrl = appService.configBaseUrl() + \"/customDisplayControl/views/birthCertificate.html\";\n                spinner.forPromise(observationsService.fetch($scope.patient.uuid, conceptNames, \"latest\", undefined, $scope.visitUuid, undefined).then(function (response) {\n                    $scope.observations = response.data;\n                }), element);\n            };\n            return {\n                restrict: 'E',\n                template: '<ng-include src=\"contentUrl\"/>',\n                link: link\n            }\n    }])]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"3f50859a-3cdf-41c0-8e4d-b9535cbd90aa\"><ac:rich-text-body><ul><li>In the above example, the concept names we want to fetch is configured in the variable&nbsp;<strong>conceptNames</strong>.</li><li>To display the spinner for each display control while loading,&nbsp;<strong>element&nbsp;</strong>should be passed in spinner.forPromise() as shown in the above example.</li><li>You can create your own template in the directive &quot;<strong>openmrs/apps/customDisplayControl/views/</strong>&quot;</li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3>Create a birthCertificate Display page</h3><p>Consider&nbsp;the following example to create&nbsp;a birthCertificate.html:</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"11a319be-ef47-46c6-ae00-a2aebbbd0275\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">xml</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"linenumbers\">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<div>\n    {{config.title}}\n    <section class=\"dashboard-section\">\n        <ul class=\"form-field\">\n            <li ng-repeat=\"obsGroup in observations\">\n                <span class=\"obs-date\"> {{obsGroup.conceptNameToDisplay }} </span>\n                <span class=\"obs-date\"> {{obsGroup.value}} </span>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n</div>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">White</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Display Controls</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"29ef04e9-1015-4259-b197-362659aadaa1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"page\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Display Controls\" ri:version-at-save=\"153\" /></ac:link></ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
